00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:09,625
Sejuknya.

243
00:20:29,144 --> 00:20:30,395
Mereka tak takut?

244
00:20:30,479 --> 00:20:32,105
Kenapa buat perkara begini?

245
00:20:33,982 --> 00:20:35,150
Saya pun tak faham.

246
00:20:36,485 --> 00:20:37,527
Ia mengujakan.

247
00:20:38,278 --> 00:20:39,154
Rasa bernyawa.

248
00:20:40,614 --> 00:20:41,949
Jung Jae-i!

249
00:20:44,785 --> 00:20:45,619
Lama tak jumpa.

250
00:20:47,371 --> 00:20:49,373
- Saya amat rindukan awak.
- Sihat?

251
00:20:50,916 --> 00:20:53,126
Pakaian awak unik hari ini.

252
00:21:32,332 --> 00:21:35,002
Dah lama kita tak berkumpul bersama-sama.

253
00:21:35,085 --> 00:21:36,336
Nak ke mana selepas ini?

254
00:21:36,420 --> 00:21:38,130
Kita perlu berseronok hari ini.

255
00:21:38,213 --> 00:21:39,047
Jung Jae-i.

256
00:21:41,091 --> 00:21:42,467
Tak nak cakap apa-apa?

257
00:21:45,929 --> 00:21:47,139
- He-ra.
- Ya.

258
00:21:47,639 --> 00:21:49,308
Saya akan bertaruh dengan Ri-an.

259
00:21:50,892 --> 00:21:52,978
Bertaruh? Pertaruhan apa?

260
00:21:53,061 --> 00:21:54,604
Penuhi permintaan pemenang.

261
00:21:55,897 --> 00:21:57,190
Permintaan apa?

262
00:21:58,317 --> 00:21:59,234
Menang dulu.

263
00:22:00,235 --> 00:22:03,030
Saya menang jika mendahului
lepas tiga pusingan.

264
00:22:03,113 --> 00:22:04,781
Jangan persoal keputusan.

265
00:22:04,865 --> 00:22:06,033
Menang baru cakap.

266
00:22:06,616 --> 00:22:07,659
Jika saya menang,

267
00:22:08,910 --> 00:22:10,579
awak perlu terangkan

268
00:22:11,997 --> 00:22:13,457
sebab awak buat begini.

269
00:24:15,245 --> 00:24:17,330
Kenapa mereka berdua buat begini?

270
00:24:18,915 --> 00:24:21,293
- Perlu buat sampai begini?
- Entahlah.

271
00:26:15,198 --> 00:26:17,993
Kenapa kejar saya secara berbahaya?

272
00:26:18,076 --> 00:26:19,202
Kalau cedera?

273
00:26:19,286 --> 00:26:20,537
Saya menang.

274
00:26:21,955 --> 00:26:22,998
Saya dah menang.

275
00:26:24,833 --> 00:26:25,875
Saya nak beritahu…

276
00:26:27,836 --> 00:26:28,712
permintaan saya.

277
00:26:31,965 --> 00:26:34,175
Kita putus, Ri-an.

278
00:26:51,568 --> 00:26:53,278
- He-ra.
- Ya?

279
00:26:53,361 --> 00:26:54,237
Jom.

280
00:26:58,199 --> 00:27:01,620
Kenapa dia jadi begitu?
Apa terjadi sebelum dia ke Amerika?

281
00:27:02,495 --> 00:27:04,914
Saya tak tahu. Entahlah.

282
00:27:06,583 --> 00:27:08,418
Ini kali pertama mereka begini.

283
00:27:12,922 --> 00:27:13,757
Ulang semula.

284
00:27:15,425 --> 00:27:17,844
Kita berpisah. Kita putus.

285
00:27:18,762 --> 00:27:19,804
Kenapa?

286
00:27:21,431 --> 00:27:23,516
Saya tanya kenapa awak jadi begini!

287
00:27:24,684 --> 00:27:27,979
Awak seperti orang lain
apabila bersama saya

288
00:27:28,063 --> 00:27:31,232
dan hilang tiba-tiba
untuk dua, tak tiga bulan

289
00:27:31,316 --> 00:27:32,817
tapi apa awak kata?

290
00:27:34,194 --> 00:27:36,321
Kita kenal buat kali pertama
sewaktu enam tahun.

291
00:27:37,113 --> 00:27:39,491
Sewaktu kita 15 tahun, awak cakap yang

292
00:27:39,991 --> 00:27:41,993
awak jatuh cinta pandang pertama.

293
00:27:44,329 --> 00:27:45,163
Kenapa?

294
00:27:46,831 --> 00:27:48,124
Kenapa sukakan saya?

295
00:27:48,208 --> 00:27:49,793
Tiada sebab. Saya cuma…

296
00:27:49,876 --> 00:27:51,544
Betul. Tiada sebab.

297
00:27:52,879 --> 00:27:54,255
Memang tiada sebab

298
00:27:55,382 --> 00:27:57,175
untuk menyukai atau membenci.

299
00:27:57,258 --> 00:27:58,635
Hei!

300
00:28:00,387 --> 00:28:01,554
Kita berkawan.

301
00:28:02,597 --> 00:28:04,057
Kita jadi kawan saja.

302
00:28:05,433 --> 00:28:07,352
Saya menang pertaruhan.

303
00:28:07,977 --> 00:28:09,062
Tepati janji awak.

304
00:28:10,146 --> 00:28:10,980
Hei, Jae-i.

305
00:28:12,190 --> 00:28:13,191
Jae-i!

306
00:28:14,484 --> 00:28:15,318
Cis!

307
00:28:51,479 --> 00:28:52,397
Kacaknya.

308
00:28:52,480 --> 00:28:55,024
Penyangak Jooshin nampak kacak hari ini.

309
00:28:55,608 --> 00:28:58,069
Nampak tangannya berbalut? Dia cedera?

310
00:29:01,489 --> 00:29:03,199
Jae-i. Ini teh Rooibos.

311
00:29:04,784 --> 00:29:06,244
- Terima kasih.
- Semalam

312
00:29:06,828 --> 00:29:07,662
selamat balik?

313
00:29:09,998 --> 00:29:12,208
Ri-an cedera. Apa terjadi antara…

314
00:29:12,292 --> 00:29:13,126
He-ra.

315
00:29:14,461 --> 00:29:15,545
Saya tak nak berbual.

316
00:29:18,298 --> 00:29:20,550
Okey. Kita berbual nanti.

317
00:29:44,824 --> 00:29:46,451
Tiada pengumuman khas.

318
00:29:47,410 --> 00:29:50,622
Jika mahu tukar kelas,
sila buat permohonan minggu ini.

319
00:29:51,247 --> 00:29:54,125
Mari tamatkan semester ini dengan baik.

320
00:29:54,751 --> 00:29:56,961
Fokus pada kelas hari ini.

321
00:29:59,798 --> 00:30:02,258
Ketua kelas, tolong jumpa saya.

322
00:30:06,721 --> 00:30:08,723
Awak main selo? Saya pilih flut.

323
00:30:08,807 --> 00:30:11,226
Mungkin selo
sebab tak sempat belajar flut.

324
00:30:11,810 --> 00:30:13,353
Saya nak tanya sesuatu.

325
00:30:14,604 --> 00:30:15,730
Bagaimana tukar kelas?

326
00:30:16,397 --> 00:30:17,232
Apa?

327
00:30:17,315 --> 00:30:20,360
Ada kelas seperti main pedang
tapi tiada dalam jadual saya.

328
00:30:20,443 --> 00:30:22,070
Kenapa tanya saya?

329
00:30:23,321 --> 00:30:24,864
Tanya kawan awak.

330
00:30:25,824 --> 00:30:26,658
Kawan?

331
00:30:32,622 --> 00:30:34,165
- Awak.
- Kenapa?

332
00:30:34,249 --> 00:30:36,084
Bagaimana nak tukar kelas?

333
00:30:38,127 --> 00:30:39,587
Jadual acara utama semester ini.

334
00:30:42,674 --> 00:30:43,675
Ju-won.

335
00:30:43,758 --> 00:30:46,052
Tolong jaga pelajar biasiswa baru.

336
00:30:46,135 --> 00:30:47,679
Awak ketua kelas.

337
00:30:47,762 --> 00:30:49,848
Bantu dia biasakan diri di sini.

338
00:30:50,932 --> 00:30:52,267
Pastikan kejadian dulu

339
00:30:53,726 --> 00:30:55,103
tak berulang lagi.

340
00:30:57,981 --> 00:30:59,023
Baik, cikgu.

341
00:31:04,696 --> 00:31:06,865
- Solekan saya melampau?
- Tak. Okey.

342
00:31:08,157 --> 00:31:09,868
Dah berbincang dengan Jae-i?

343
00:31:09,951 --> 00:31:11,244
Bibir saja berbeza.

344
00:31:11,786 --> 00:31:12,704
Tiada sebab.

345
00:31:12,787 --> 00:31:14,539
Memang tiada sebab

346
00:31:16,040 --> 00:31:17,792
untuk menyukai atau membenci.

347
00:31:18,376 --> 00:31:19,502
Guna jenama apa?

348
00:31:19,586 --> 00:31:21,588
Saya bawa semua kecuali gincu.

349
00:31:21,671 --> 00:31:23,298
- Gincu saja.
- Ini.

350
00:31:23,381 --> 00:31:25,758
Jae-i tiba-tiba elak awak
dan ke Amerika.

351
00:31:26,259 --> 00:31:28,928
Hubungan awak goyah
sejak parti hari lahir saya.

352
00:31:29,012 --> 00:31:30,805
Awak langsung tak tahu kenapa?

353
00:31:31,306 --> 00:31:33,850
Sesuatu yang boleh buat Jae-i marah?

354
00:31:36,561 --> 00:31:37,729
Entah.

355
00:31:37,812 --> 00:31:40,607
Kalau fikir pun, kita takkan tahu.

356
00:31:40,690 --> 00:31:42,525
Kita takkan faham sebab wanita

357
00:31:42,609 --> 00:31:43,985
tiba-tiba marah dan merajuk.

358
00:31:44,569 --> 00:31:45,904
Hoi.

359
00:31:45,987 --> 00:31:48,907
Minta maaf sahaja
walaupun tak tahu sebabnya.

360
00:31:48,990 --> 00:31:50,617
Baru dia akan terangkan

361
00:31:50,700 --> 00:31:53,077
sebab dia sedih dan kecil hati,

362
00:31:53,161 --> 00:31:54,913
tapi dengar pun tak faham.

363
00:31:59,751 --> 00:32:00,919
Saya setuju dengannya.

364
00:32:01,544 --> 00:32:03,338
Awak perlu minta maaf.

365
00:32:03,421 --> 00:32:05,340
Adakalanya kami mahukan kepastian.

366
00:32:06,382 --> 00:32:07,216
Kepastian?

367
00:32:07,300 --> 00:32:09,677
Walaupun kami marah tanpa sebab, kata

368
00:32:09,761 --> 00:32:12,221
"Saya minta maaf.
Saya tak boleh hidup tanpa awak."

369
00:32:12,305 --> 00:32:13,973
Itulah yang kami idamkan.

370
00:32:15,058 --> 00:32:16,059
Jae-i begitu?

371
00:32:16,142 --> 00:32:17,352
Bukankah dia wanita?

372
00:32:17,852 --> 00:32:19,729
Buat esok. Kita jumpa di vila.

373
00:32:20,271 --> 00:32:22,690
Sudah lama kita tak berseronok.

374
00:32:22,774 --> 00:32:24,108
Pasti menyeronokkan.

375
00:32:24,192 --> 00:32:25,234
- Betul tak?
- Ya.

376
00:32:25,318 --> 00:32:26,694
- Buat persediaan.
- Apa?

377
00:32:26,778 --> 00:32:29,739
Dia takkan duduk di situ, bukan?

378
00:32:31,908 --> 00:32:32,742
Awak dah gila?

379
00:32:36,996 --> 00:32:37,830
Ke tepi.

380
00:32:45,004 --> 00:32:48,007
Awak tak tahu bezakan
langit dan bumi, Kang Ha?

381
00:32:48,800 --> 00:32:49,884
Saya?

382
00:32:49,968 --> 00:32:52,470
Ri-an belum bangun
tapi awak bangun dulu?

383
00:32:53,429 --> 00:32:55,682
Awak masuk kelas khas, bilik muzik

384
00:32:55,765 --> 00:32:57,100
dan duduk sesuka hati.

385
00:32:57,600 --> 00:32:58,851
Hari ini pula?

386
00:32:58,935 --> 00:33:00,603
Nak duduk dalam stadium?

387
00:33:01,854 --> 00:33:03,648
Kenapa? Apa masalahnya?

388
00:33:04,232 --> 00:33:06,401
Dia terlalu naif.

389
00:33:06,484 --> 00:33:09,112
Wajah, otak dan cara pemikirannya bersih.

390
00:33:09,195 --> 00:33:12,365
Dia tanya cara nak tukar kelas
kepada Gil Ye-ji.

391
00:33:12,448 --> 00:33:13,783
Anak tuan Pasar Raya Jooshin?

392
00:33:18,037 --> 00:33:19,247
Kenapa dengan kelas?

393
00:33:19,747 --> 00:33:21,040
Apa yang awak nak ubah?

394
00:33:21,624 --> 00:33:24,252
Sini ada kelas berkayuh dan main pedang.

395
00:33:25,837 --> 00:33:26,671
Awak berminat?

396
00:33:26,754 --> 00:33:28,172
Sekolah lama tiada kelas itu.

397
00:33:28,256 --> 00:33:30,800
Mungkin sini ada sebab ini sekolah hebat.

398
00:33:30,883 --> 00:33:31,968
Tukar di bilik guru.

399
00:33:33,177 --> 00:33:34,053
Tapi

400
00:33:34,929 --> 00:33:36,889
awak ada duit nak bayar kelas khas?

401
00:33:36,973 --> 00:33:39,517
Harga kelas berkayuh
40 juta won satu semester

402
00:33:39,600 --> 00:33:41,352
tapi main pedang murah sikit.

403
00:33:41,436 --> 00:33:42,437
40 juta won?

404
00:33:43,438 --> 00:33:44,897
Mahalnya.

405
00:33:50,236 --> 00:33:52,155
Dengar sini, Kang Ha.

406
00:33:53,740 --> 00:33:56,492
Sekolah ini berbeza
daripada sekolah lama awak.

407
00:33:56,576 --> 00:33:58,161
Jooshin ada peraturan tersendiri.

408
00:33:59,078 --> 00:34:00,204
Apa peraturannya?

409
00:34:00,788 --> 00:34:02,707
Jangan menyakitkan hati orang.

410
00:34:03,708 --> 00:34:04,584
Hati siapa?

411
00:34:04,667 --> 00:34:09,172
Pelajar kelas atasan seperti Jae-i,
He-ra, Woo-jin dan terutamanya Ri-an.

412
00:34:09,255 --> 00:34:10,715
Kenapa pula?

413
00:34:10,798 --> 00:34:13,092
Awak tanya kenapa? Bukankah jelas?

414
00:34:13,176 --> 00:34:14,385
Mereka berbeza.

415
00:34:14,469 --> 00:34:16,012
Kita pelajar biasiswa.

416
00:34:16,512 --> 00:34:18,848
Warna tali leher melambangkan status

417
00:34:18,931 --> 00:34:20,099
sebab kita berbeza.

418
00:34:20,183 --> 00:34:22,977
Kita berwarna biru tua
dan mereka merah manggis.

419
00:34:23,978 --> 00:34:26,522
Ri-an istimewa sebab
moyangnya pengasas sekolah ini.

420
00:34:27,523 --> 00:34:30,151
Yang lain pula dah tiga generasi
belajar di sini.

421
00:34:30,777 --> 00:34:33,362
Pelajar dari keluarga penyumbang berbeza.

422
00:34:33,946 --> 00:34:36,365
Sumbangan mereka
ialah sebab kita di sini.

423
00:34:37,992 --> 00:34:40,119
Jadi mereka sepatutnya dihormati.

424
00:34:43,081 --> 00:34:43,915
Hormat?

425
00:34:43,998 --> 00:34:46,501
Jangan berfikir! Jangan tanya soalan!

426
00:34:46,584 --> 00:34:47,919
Ingat sahaja!

427
00:34:48,002 --> 00:34:49,670
"Saya takkan bergerak sesuka hati.

428
00:34:49,754 --> 00:34:52,173
Saya akan cuba
untuk tak mengganggu mereka."

429
00:34:52,256 --> 00:34:53,841
Susah sangat nak faham?

430
00:34:53,925 --> 00:34:55,051
Tidak, cuma…

431
00:34:55,927 --> 00:34:57,845
Hormat? Okey. Saya faham.

432
00:34:58,638 --> 00:35:00,681
Tapi kita kawan. Takkan tak boleh…

433
00:35:01,557 --> 00:35:03,309
Melampau jika tak boleh ganggu.

434
00:35:04,143 --> 00:35:06,229
Nak anggap ini melampau? Suka hati.

435
00:35:07,063 --> 00:35:10,108
Kalau rasa ia melampau pun,
lebih baik patuh.

436
00:35:16,489 --> 00:35:18,241
Tahu kenapa awak ada di sini?

437
00:35:22,453 --> 00:35:24,831
Sebab ada kekosongan di semester baru.

438
00:35:26,457 --> 00:35:27,959
Kenapa ada kekosongan?

439
00:35:29,961 --> 00:35:30,962
Pelajar biasiswa…

440
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:35,258
yang tak dengar kata-kata saya…

441
00:35:40,513 --> 00:35:42,265
telah dibunuh oleh Ri-an.

442
00:36:03,536 --> 00:36:04,704
Okey.

443
00:36:07,123 --> 00:36:09,250
Saya faham apa awak nak kata.

444
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:13,629
Maksud awak,
saya perlu berkawan dengan mereka

445
00:36:13,713 --> 00:36:15,298
agar tidak diganggu, kan?

446
00:36:17,925 --> 00:36:19,969
Terima kasih atas amaran awak.

447
00:36:25,266 --> 00:36:27,226
Dia faham maksud kita, bukan?

448
00:36:27,310 --> 00:36:29,228
Kenapa dia berani sangat?

449
00:36:36,569 --> 00:36:38,946
Saya belum kenalkan diri
walaupun dah lama di sini.

450
00:36:42,533 --> 00:36:44,619
Awak ingat nama saya? Saya Kang Ha.

451
00:36:46,204 --> 00:36:47,455
Mari berkawan, Ri-an.

452
00:36:58,966 --> 00:37:00,176
Dia ingat dia siapa?

453
00:37:00,801 --> 00:37:02,261
Apa yang awak buat?

454
00:37:03,095 --> 00:37:04,847
- Halau dia.
- Maaf, Yun-seok.

455
00:37:06,182 --> 00:37:07,141
Hoi, tak guna.

456
00:37:07,225 --> 00:37:09,602
Apa ini? Awak mempermainkannya?

457
00:37:09,685 --> 00:37:10,853
Langsung tidak.

458
00:37:10,937 --> 00:37:12,980
Apa mereka kata? Kami raksasa?

459
00:37:13,481 --> 00:37:15,775
Elok berbaik dengan kami
jika tak nak dibuli?

460
00:37:16,651 --> 00:37:17,818
Apa?

461
00:37:18,527 --> 00:37:21,322
Mereka mempermainkan awak.
Mereka bergurau saja.

462
00:37:22,240 --> 00:37:24,617
Saya patut adakan parti lebih awal.

463
00:37:24,700 --> 00:37:26,035
Baru tak dipermainkan.

464
00:37:26,535 --> 00:37:27,370
Ada masa esok?

465
00:37:28,871 --> 00:37:30,373
Ada parti kemasukan baru.

466
00:37:30,957 --> 00:37:31,832
Parti kemasukan?

467
00:37:32,917 --> 00:37:34,669
Jumpa esok.
Pemandu saya jemput awak.

468
00:37:36,295 --> 00:37:37,129
Babai.

469
00:37:38,172 --> 00:37:39,924
Datanglah. Kami tunggu.

470
00:38:06,701 --> 00:38:07,952
Ini dah cukup baik.

471
00:38:08,035 --> 00:38:09,328
Adakah Jae-i suka

472
00:38:10,705 --> 00:38:12,039
perkara sebegini?

473
00:38:12,123 --> 00:38:13,082
Mungkin?

474
00:38:14,292 --> 00:38:15,459
Saya tanya lokasinya.

475
00:38:18,629 --> 00:38:20,423
Ini bukan apa yang Jae-i suka.

476
00:38:45,990 --> 00:38:47,033
Jae-i!

477
00:38:47,116 --> 00:38:49,869
Saya takkan mulakan parti
sehingga awak sampai.

478
00:38:51,871 --> 00:38:52,830
Cepat datang.

479
00:39:24,570 --> 00:39:26,614
Barangan elektronik
tak boleh dibawa masuk.

480
00:39:26,697 --> 00:39:28,699
Serahkan telefon dan barangan elektronik.

481
00:39:28,783 --> 00:39:30,618
Semua dipulangkan sewaktu balik.

482
00:39:31,327 --> 00:39:32,661
Baiklah.

483
00:39:48,010 --> 00:39:48,844
Oh?

484
00:39:49,428 --> 00:39:52,056
Awak memang datang bila disuruh!

485
00:39:53,808 --> 00:39:54,642
Ke tepi.

